## Overview

DaoLens is a startup founded in January 2022 by Apoorv Nandan and Vikram Aditya. It builds tools for Web3 adoption, from helping people find DAOs (decentralised autonomous organisations) that suit them, to helping DAOs onboard and manage their contributors.

I joined as a graphic design intern from August to December 2022, based in Bengaluru, with Riya Allen as my mentor. Most of my work was the day-to-day visual output a small startup needs: social posts, banners, Discord assets, short animations and presentation decks.

{% stats %}
{% stat value="5 months" label="Aug to Dec 2022" /%}
{% stat value="15" label="Types of graphic requests I worked on" /%}
