{% /gallery %}

![DeepDAO and r/dao banners offering free onboarding](/work/daolens/website-and-rdao-banners.webp "Website banner and r/dao poster")

### Decks, handbooks and animation

I designed a beginner's handbook for Grape DAO, a Solana community. It explains who the platform is for, the problems it solves, how to become a member, the tools it offers and how to get in touch.

![Pages from the Grape DAO handbook](/work/daolens/grape-dao-handbook.webp "Grape DAO handbook for beginners")

I also designed "The art of community", a deck carrying Safary's branding that covers community types, segments and community-building tactics. Smaller jobs included updating slides for DaoLens's own presentations and short brand animations.

![Slides from The art of community deck](/work/daolens/community-deck.webp "The art of community deck")

